      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经历新马级后，\n成长幅度超乎想像的稻荷一提出了目标──\n爬上地方与中央双方的“巅峰”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "889be940f5308a535ea2d0a161dcd90332df74ac6b540d948bac36aa2667567f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034419.json",
      "json_path": [
