      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是在经典级称霸“东京大赏典”，\n在古马级于中央GⅠ不断跑出好成绩，\n并获得“年度代表赛马娘”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b46de9e670e0a1a9072dc545956c70063f39dd864478054c5946e2fe14dc88e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
