    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d46fc4b343c91bb5bd9c3f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是稻荷就这样一决定了“巅峰”的定义。\n本想将第一个目标\n定为“东京大赏典”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ee9a2026999ae0cdd757ba9c60a649ed2bb74c93c2ee9c5722894b4f37e739",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034419.json",
      "json_path": [
