      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是为了在那之前\n累积大井赛场的实战经验，\n下个目标就决定是“日本沙土德比”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68e6288d7b858a69e38561e3d30e452581638a816a9a3d93527906fdaaea86e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71206b27cda6633aab751690",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标达成后・目标是巅峰",
