      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一以竭尽全力的表现赢下“宝冢纪念”，\n并且受到玉藻十字赞赏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3ac6121c125d1735b3016e742529a4260d50577503f1197d27742950c3851f7",
