    {
      "uid": "zhcn:312234247b06d767c794867d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，稻荷一从玉藻十字威风凛凛的态度\n及展望未来的姿态中得到收获，\n发誓明年也一定要在这场比赛跑出成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc52373ef7851302b69eeda699d46b280b3787d679213c59f1e1a6d6ad3bbd06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
